loud appeared and enveloped them, and they were afraid as they entered the cloud.","9:35":"And a voice came from the cloud, saying, “This is My Son, whom I have chosen. Listen to Him!”","9:36":"After the voice had spoken, only Jesus was present with them. The disciples kept this to themselves, and in those days they did not tell anyone what they had seen."}}},"pairs":{"mt-mk":{"exact":87,"lemma":7,"pctA":56.0,"pctB":60.3,"run":10,"runText":"τρεῖς σκηνάς σοὶ μίαν καὶ Μωϋσεῖ μίαν καὶ Ἠλίᾳ μίαν"},"mt-lk":{"exact":38,"lemma":10,"pctA":28.6,"pctB":27.0,"run":10,"runText":"ἐκ τῆς νεφέλης λέγουσα Οὗτός ἐστιν ὁ υἱός μου ὁ"},"mk-lk":{"exact":41,"lemma":15,"pctA":35.9,"pctB":31.5,"run":7,"runText":"καλόν ἐστιν ἡμᾶς ὧδε εἶναι καὶ ποιήσωμεν"}},"minor":[{"mt":31,"lk":30,"l":2,"word":"πρόσωπον","gloss":"face","content":1,"sig":1},{"mt":89,"lk":130,"l":3,"word":"αὐτούς","gloss":"them","content":0,"sig":0},{"mt":96,"lk":146,"l":3,"word":"λέγουσα","gloss":"saying","content":1,"sig":1}]}